---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { colors } from '../lib/palette';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    <meta name="description" content="Tokiwagi UI は、色と意味をそろえたタスク管理アプリのデザインシステムです。カラーとアイコンのルールは Storybook で確認できます。" />
    <title>Tokiwagi UI — 色と意味を、ひとつずつ。</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">本文へスキップ</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Tokiwagi UI ホーム"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>tokiwagi<span class="brand-muted"> ui</span></span></a>
      <nav aria-label="ページ内ナビゲーション">
        <a href="#principles">デザインの考え方</a>
        <a href="#foundations">基盤</a>
        <a class="nav-storybook" href="http://localhost:6006/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Storybook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A DESIGN SYSTEM FOR EVERYDAY MOMENTS</div>
          <h1 id="hero-title">色と意味を、<br /><em>ひとつずつ。</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">タスクの毎日を、明るく、わかりやすく。<br />Tokiwagi UI は、選ぶ色と伝える意味を丁寧にそろえるデザインシステムです。</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button-primary" href="http://localhost:6006/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Storybook で見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="text-link" href="#foundations">基盤について見る <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="local-note">ローカルで <code>bun run storybook</code> を起動すると閲覧できます。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-label="7色のプライマリーカラー">
          <div class="art-grid">{colors.map(([key, name], index) => <div class="art-card" style={`--card-color:var(--tkw-color-primary-${key});--card-ink:var(--tkw-color-primary-${key}-on);--card-angle:${(index - 3) * 2}deg`}><span class="art-index">0{index + 1}</span><span class="art-letter" aria-hidden="true">t.</span><span class="art-name">{name}</span></div>)}</div>
          <div class="art-caption"><span>SEVEN EQUAL COLORS</span><span>LIGHT THEME / 01</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="principles section-shell" id="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
        <div class="section-intro"><span class="section-kicker">01 / PRINCIPLES</span><h2 id="principles-title">それぞれの色に、<br />それぞれの出番。</h2><p>ひとつの色を主役に決めず、使う場面に合わせて選ぶ。状態を色だけに頼らず、ことばやアイコンでも伝える。毎日の操作に一貫した手がかりを作ります。</p></div>
        <div class="principle-list">
          <article><span class="principle-number">01</span><div><h3>7色は対等な主役</h3><p>プロジェクトやカテゴリごとに選び、同じ対象には同じ色を使います。</p></div></article>
          <article><span class="principle-number">02</span><div><h3>意味はいつも同じ</h3><p>成功・警告・エラー・情報は、専用の状態色と説明を組み合わせます。</p></div></article>
          <article><span class="principle-number">03</span><div><h3>見て、確かめて、作る</h3><p>トークン、操作状態、文字とのコントラストを Storybook で確認できます。</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="foundations section-shell" id="foundations" aria-labelledby="foundations-title">
        <div class="section-topline"><span class="section-kicker">02 / FOUNDATIONS</span><span>THE BUILDING BLOCKS</span></div>
        <div class="foundations-heading"><h2 id="foundations-title">つくるための、<br />共通の基盤。</h2><p>カラーの確定ルールと、アイコンの命名・用途案を Storybook にまとめています。実装するときの参照先です。</p></div>
        <div class="foundation-grid">
          <article class="foundation-card color-card"><div class="foundation-card-top"><span>01 / COLORS</span><span>確定</span></div><div class="color-mini" aria-hidden="true">{colors.map(([key]) => <span style={`background:var(--tkw-color-primary-${key})`}></span>)}</div><h3>カラー</h3><p>プライマリー、セカンダリー、状態色、ニュートラル。全93トークンの値と使い方、背景と文字の組み合わせを確認できます。</p><a href="http://localhost:6006/?path=/docs/カラー-使用ルール--docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ルールを見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="foundation-card icon-card"><div class="foundation-card-top"><span>02 / ICONS</span><span>案</span></div><div class="icon-mini" aria-hidden="true"><span>←</span><span>⌕</span><span>✓</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>アイコン</h3><p>操作・状態・ブランドを用途から整理。公開名と既存アプリの参照 ID を確認できます。図形はこれから制作します。</p><a href="http://localhost:6006/?path=/docs/アイコン-命名と用途の案--docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">用途案を見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="closing section-shell" aria-labelledby="closing-title"><div><span class="section-kicker">START BUILDING</span><h2 id="closing-title">同じルールから、<br />新しい画面へ。</h2></div><div><p>Storybook を開き、色と用途を確かめながら実装を進めます。</p><a class="button-primary" href="http://localhost:6006/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Storybook を開く <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>tokiwagi<span class="brand-muted"> ui</span></span></a><span>Color with purpose, meaning with clarity.</span><a href="#top">ページの先頭へ ↑</a></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root { font-family: Inter, "Noto Sans JP", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: var(--tkw-color-neutral-50); color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-900); color-scheme: light; font-synthesis: none; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { margin: 0; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-900); outline-offset: 5px; }
  code { font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace; }
  .skip-link { position: absolute; top: -100px; left: 16px; z-index: 10; padding: 10px 14px; background: white; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 12px; }
  .site-header, footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; max-width: 1480px; margin: auto; padding: 24px 4.5%; }
  .site-header { min-height: 86px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 760; letter-spacing: -.08em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .brand-muted { color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-weight: 430; }
  .brand-mark { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 7px); gap: 3px; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  .brand-mark i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--tkw-color-primary-green); }
  .brand-mark i:nth-child(2) { background: var(--tkw-color-primary-teal); }
  .brand-mark i:nth-child(3) { background: var(--tkw-color-primary-rose); }
  .brand-mark i:nth-child(4) { background: var(--tkw-color-primary-amber); }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: clamp(16px, 3vw, 38px); font-size: 12px; }
  nav a:hover, footer a:last-child:hover, .text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .nav-storybook { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 100px); max-width: 1480px; min-height: 650px; margin: auto; padding: 70px 4.5% 94px; }
  .eyebrow, .section-kicker { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .eyebrow-line { width: 18px; height: 1px; background: var(--tkw-color-neutral-800); }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
  h1 { margin: 27px 0 24px; font-size: clamp(52px, 6vw, 100px); font-weight: 680; letter-spacing: -.085em; line-height: 1.22; }
  h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--tkw-color-primary-rose-on-subtle); }
  .hero-lead { color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 15px; line-height: 2; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin-top: 35px; }
  .button-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 34px; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--tkw-color-neutral-900); color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-0); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; }
  .button-primary:hover { background: var(--tkw-color-neutral-800); }
  .button-primary:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  .text-link { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .local-note { margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 11px; }
  .local-note code { color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-800); }
  .hero-art { min-width: 0; }
  .art-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; align-items: stretch; min-height: 350px; }
  .art-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; min-width: 0; padding: 12px 7px; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--card-color); color: var(--card-ink); transform: rotate(var(--card-angle)); transition: transform .25s ease; }
  .art-card:hover { transform: translateY(-9px) rotate(0); }
  .art-index, .art-name { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; writing-mode: vertical-rl; }
  .art-letter { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 39px); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.08em; writing-mode: vertical-rl; }
  .art-caption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 17px; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .section-shell { max-width: 1480px; margin: auto; padding: 100px 4.5%; }
  .principles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10%; border-top: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); }
  .section-intro h2, .foundations-heading h2, .closing h2 { margin: 21px 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 56px); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: 1.4; }
  .section-intro > p, .foundations-heading p, .closing p { max-width: 450px; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 13px; line-height: 2; }
  .principle-list article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; gap: 18px; padding: 25px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); }
  .principle-list article:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); }
  .principle-number { padding-top: 3px; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 11px; }
  .principle-list h3 { margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 17px; }
  .principle-list p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .foundations { border-top: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); }
  .section-topline { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .foundations-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .foundations-heading p { max-width: 340px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .foundation-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .foundation-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 360px; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--tkw-color-neutral-0); }
  .foundation-card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .color-mini { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 5px; height: 83px; margin: 32px 0 24px; }
  .color-mini span { border-radius: 5px; }
  .icon-mini { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; height: 83px; margin: 32px 0 24px; }
  .icon-mini span { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--tkw-color-neutral-100); color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-800); font-size: 27px; }
  .foundation-card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px; }
  .foundation-card p { max-width: 450px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .foundation-card a { display: inline-flex; gap: 20px; align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .foundation-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .closing { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 35px; margin-bottom: 80px; border-top: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); }
  .closing h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .closing > div:last-child { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .closing p { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--tkw-color-neutral-200); color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-600); font-size: 11px; }
  footer .brand { color: var(--tkw-color-neutral-900); }
  @media (max-width: 850px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; padding-top: 62px; } .hero-art { max-width: 700px; } .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .site-header { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; } nav { gap: 17px; } .hero { padding-top: 45px; } h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 13vw, 74px); } .art-grid { min-height: 230px; } .art-card { padding: 8px 4px; } .art-name, .art-index { font-size: 8px; } .section-shell { padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 70px; } .foundations-heading, .closing { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } .foundations-heading p { margin-bottom: 0; } .foundation-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .closing { margin-bottom: 0; } footer { flex-wrap: wrap; } }
</style>
